        "description": "Urinary incontinence due to bladder dysfunction",
        "category": "supportive",
        "requiredForDiagnosis": false
      }
    ],
    "minimumForDiagnosis": "Presence of bladder mucosa eversion through the abdominal wall with pubic symphysis diastasis and epispadias",
